# NOTE: Vendor/python/ (the embedded Windows runtime, ~97 MB) IS committed on
# purpose — the bench is offline and its only Python is an untouchable 2.x, so
# "download the repo" has to be enough on its own.  See Vendor/README.md;
# rebuild with Vendor/make_offline_bundle.py.  Only build leftovers are ignored:
Vendor/wheels/
.bundle-cache/

# config.yaml 里有管理密码和宽带账号。仓库里那份是**空值模板**,可以提交;
# 台架上填了真密码之后就别再提交它了(要么在本机 git update-index
# --skip-worktree Scene/router_dial_switch/config.yaml,要么干脆别在台架上用 git)。
# 旧的 router.yaml / perf.yaml / perf_configs/ 已经并进 config.yaml 并删掉,
# 对照表见 MIGRATION.md。

# 运行产物:截图/诊断证据。都是每次跑动现场生成的,不进仓库
# (diagnose 产物可能含会话 token / 表单里的账号密码 —— 回传前先脱敏)
# Scene/*/artifacts/ 整个忽略,但**目录本身要留着** —— skill 让 agent 把控件清单、
# 进度文件、崩溃报告写在这里;新克隆里没有这个目录的话,第一条重定向
# 命令就会失败(2026-07-30 实测)。所以用 Scene/*/artifacts/* + 放行 .gitkeep。
Scene/*/artifacts/*
!Scene/*/artifacts/.gitkeep
!Scene/*/artifacts/README.md
!Scene/*/artifacts/reports/
!Scene/*/artifacts/shots/
!Scene/*/artifacts/probes/
Scene/*/artifacts/reports/*
Scene/*/artifacts/shots/*
Scene/*/artifacts/probes/*
!Scene/*/artifacts/*/.gitkeep
recordings/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
venv/
.venv/

# diagnose evidence dumps may contain session tokens / form values -- never commit
Scene/*/artifacts/diagnose_*.json

# Chariot 的原始测试记录。正常情况下它们落在 Scene/*/artifacts/ 里(已忽略),
# 这条是兜底:旧版本会把它们丢在仓库根目录。
*.tst
